				value      	FALSE))
			quid       	"3B2371E803B4"
			documentation 	
|Title:        Function<p>
| * Description:  Defines Interfaces and Default Implementations for Functions. <p>
| * Copyright:    Copyright (c) Matthias Heuer<p>
