				uid        	0)
			    (object Operation "UnMap"
				attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
				quid       	"3B2371E803BE"
				documentation 	
|Returns arg Mapped in Place by this Object: this.MapAt(arg) this=°arg
|     * This is the Function working on 'arg' defined by the implementing Class.
