				documentation 	
|
| * MultiplexerOut.java
| * The MultiplexerOut is derived from the abstract Base Class AStreamOut
| * and multiplexes the Stream to a List of Output Streams in a Round Robin Fashion.
| * Any StreamOut can also be used as a DeMultiplexer
