|
|  * Title: AND.java<p>
|  * Description:
|  * Implements the AND Operation on Object Streams.
|  * Creates a Stream that contains only those Elements contained in both Streams.
|  *
|  * XOR and OR cannot be realized with Streams,
|  * without using a Random Access fast find Container like a HashTable,
|  * that act as a Set for easier checking of Existence.
|  * Rather use a Union or an XUnion that streams into a Set Container to prevent Duplicates.
|  *
|  * Known SubClasses:
|  *
|  * @see also:	Union, AND, DIFF, Product
