					quid       	"3B2371EC000C"
					documentation 	
|Interface for a Bond (so far without NOT and 0 resp. 1)
| * But already here you can define the 'SubSet' Relation, an Order Relation using
| *
| * a 'less' b <=> a Sub	  b <=> a AND b == a
| * a 'grtr' b <=> a Super b <=> a OR  b == b
| *
| * The Definition of AND and OR based on an Order Relation is done in 'MinBond'
| 
					
					stereotype 	"Interface"
					superclasses 	(list inheritance_relationship_list
					    (object Inheritance_Relationship
						attributes 	(list Attribute_Set)
						quid       	"3B2371EC00CB"
