					    (object Attribute
						tool       	"Java"
						name       	"GenerateDefaultConstructor"
						value      	FALSE))
					quid       	"3B2371EC007F"
					documentation 	
|This Interface defines the basic Operations on a Set with two Operations:
| * AND and OR. The Set together with it's Operations is called Bond ("Verband")
| * The Inverse is not defined, nor is FALSE or TRUE,
| * which usually can only be defined on finite or limited Sets (order Relation).
| *
| * The Axioms are:
| * Commutativity:
| *		 a AND b		= b AND a				 a OR b			= b OR a
| * Associativity:
| *		(a AND b) AND c = a AND (b AND c)		(a OR b) OR c	= a OR (b OR c)
| * Adjunctivity:
| *		 a AND (a OR b)	= a						 a OR (a AND b)	= a
| *
| * The name Bond is derived from the Fact that in a Bond you can always define
| * an Order Relation 'less' by defining:	a less b <=> (a AND b) = a
| * This means that any two Elements a and b are 'bonded' i.e. interconnected,
| * if you use Hasse Diagrams to display their Structure.
| * This Definition is actually used in Boole
| *
| * The DIFF Operation is also fundamental, and it can be used to define OR, because:
| * A OR B = A-B + B-A + A AND B
| * Like AND and OR, DIFF can be defined also for infinite SuperSets,
| * where NOT and TRUE cannot be defined explicitly, only analytically!
| *
| * On the other hand you can define the AND and OR Operations
| * if an Order Relation is given by:
| *	a AND b = a min b
| *  a OR  b = a max b
| * This Definition is done in Bond.MinBond 	 
					
					stereotype 	"Interface"
					operations 	(list Operations
					    (object Operation "ANDat"
						attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
						    (object Attribute
							tool       	"Java"
							name       	"Abstract"
							value      	TRUE))
						quid       	"3B2371EC0080"
						documentation 	
|AND Operation in Place: &=, &&= for single Bit
|	 * a AND b = true <=> (a = true) AND (b = true) 	 
						
						parameters 	(list Parameters
						    (object Parameter "arg"
							type       	"Object"))
						result     	"Bond"
						concurrency 	"Sequential"
						opExportControl 	"Public"
						uid        	0)
					    (object Operation "ORat"
						attributes 	(list Attribute_Set
						    (object Attribute
							tool       	"Java"
							name       	"Abstract"
							value      	TRUE))
						quid       	"3B2371EC0082"
						documentation 	
|OR Operation in Place: |=, ||= for single Bit
|	 * a OR b = true <=> (a = true) OR (b = true) 	 
						
						parameters 	(list Parameters
						    (object Parameter "arg"
							type       	"Object"))
						result     	"Bond"
						concurrency 	"Sequential"
						opExportControl 	"Public"
						uid        	0)
