|Interface for an unary operation (without Arguments) working on arg.
| *
| * Design Decisions:
| * The Parameters for 'Operation' are left out, to keep the Interface clean.
| * They have to be set globally with the concrete Class.
| *
| * The Class does only have the Operation in it's state,
| * so all Operator Instances are alike, if they don't carry additional Sematics
| * like e.g. RingFuncs.AddAt which stores the Increment.
| * Otherwise the Object should be a Singleton to enable direct == Comparison .
| 
			
